# The Ultimate Doom E3M9 (M9): started beside line 289 (special 52, tag 0), on its
# front, the player walks across it, then waits for the movers it set going
# (at most 450 tics). Written by tools/RouteGen (doom-e3m9-line289).
iwad doom
map E3M9
exit normal
start 464 -352 90

# forwardmove sidemove turn buttons [xcount]; turn << 8 = angleturn
0 0 0 0
25 0 0 0 x7
25 0 1 0
25 0 0 0
25 0 1 0
25 0 0 0
25 0 1 0
